{{!
    @template local_ai_course_assistant/course_settings_select

    One <select> on the per-course settings page.

    Every picker on that page has the same shape, so they all render through
    this partial: the provider picker, the six three-way pedagogy overrides, the
    external-resources override, the Soapbox level picker, the Voice Tab and
    Auto-open overrides and the per-quiz assistance level. They differ only in
    name, id, classes and option list, so those arrive as context.

    Labels are resolved and already translated in course_settings.php. Nothing
    here is pre-sanitised HTML, so every value is escaped.

    @package    local_ai_course_assistant
    @copyright  2026 Tom Caswell & David Ta / Saylor University
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasid": true,
        "id": "aica-socratic-mode",
        "name": "socratic_mode",
        "selectclass": "form-control form-control-sm sola-cs-select-pedagogy",
        "options": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Inherit site default (off)", "selected": true},
            {"value": "1", "label": "Force on", "selected": false},
            {"value": "0", "label": "Force off", "selected": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<select class="{{selectclass}}"{{#hasid}} id="{{id}}"{{/hasid}} name="{{name}}">
    {{#options}}
    <option value="{{value}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
    {{/options}}
</select>
